=== all shortcuts / 100 columns ===
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Keyboard shortcuts

^/ or ^?            Show or close this reference
^D                  Quit from an empty draft
^C twice / ^U       Clear the draft without stopping work
Shift+Enter / ^J    Insert a newline
Enter / Alt+Enter   Send the draft
^Z                  Take back the last turn
Enter twice         Continue or send pending notices

Editing
Tab                 Complete a word or choose a suggestion
Up / Down           Move by line or recall history
^R                  Search input history
Home / ^A           Move to the start of the line
End / ^E            Move to the end of the line
^Left / ^Right      Move by word
^Backspace / ^W     Delete the previous word
^Delete             Delete the next word
^K                  Delete to the end of the line
^G                  Edit the draft externally
^S                  Stash the draft or restore the latest stash
^Shift+S            Swap the draft with the latest stash
^L                  Redraw the conversation
^.                  Reply to the last answer in the editor

Access: press ^X, then a letter
Escape / ^C         Cancel the mode prefix
w                   Toggle workspace writes
x                   Toggle shell execution
n                   Toggle host network
g                   Toggle repository history
s                   Toggle subagents
l                   Toggle lookup

^/ or ^C closes · ↑/↓ scrolls
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
